The same unbranded steel pencil placed beside a stack of identical practice paper cards and one carefully completed blank pattern sample, rhythm of an effective habit. Make one original ultra-realistic live editorial studio photograph for the independent magazine Kompas. Wide landscape about 1.9:1, central subject inside the middle 75% for a consistent crop; clear plausible optics and readable shadow detail. Real controlled directional daylight, neutral-warm color, tactile ordinary materials, one purposeful subject and an interesting but restrained sense of depth. Photographic, no layout or decorative graphics. No people, faces, hands, silhouettes, visible lettering, numbers, logos, neon, fake interface or watermarks.
